                      %mi k
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} k
                is a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Heyting+field"} Heyting field
                which is not a discrete field, not every polynomial in
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi k
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
